{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225200","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:7:1222520001:0":{"text":"天啊……流金之地变得一片狼藉了！","source_cn":"天啊……流金之地变得一片狼藉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945EE1060A2E3A5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222520002:0":{"text":"那些堆成山的金币，宝物……还有那艘漂亮的瓶中船呢？！","source_cn":"那些堆成山的金币，宝物……还有那艘漂亮的瓶中船呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD9AF45AB647C70E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222520003:1":{"text":"我可以回答：金币和收集来的宝物，被那头野蛮的恶魔一口气吞了！瓶中船，被他一头撞碎了！","source_cn":"我可以回答：金币和收集来的宝物，被那头野蛮的恶魔一口气...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48B2FD9569F32C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222520004:1":{"text":"而且那家伙大闹完，还留下这么多污浊丑陋的魔物眷属！","source_cn":"而且那家伙大闹完，还留下这么多污浊丑陋的魔物眷属！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD46C9A2733BFB3CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222520005:1":{"text":"……吞了？那么多宝贝？他能吃得下？","source_cn":"……吞了？那么多宝贝？他能吃得下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x385DC990DF9E90E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222520006:1":{"text":"他好像什么都能吃，而且什么都想吃。","source_cn":"他好像什么都能吃，而且什么都想吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D0BFE122CCB3C15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222520007:1":{"text":"要不是我逃得快，连这双美丽的翅膀都会被那头恶魔扯下来嚼碎呢！他的眼神完全是野兽看食物的眼神。","source_cn":"要不是我逃得快，连这双美丽的翅膀都会被那头恶魔扯下来嚼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8FC6FBB503B0049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222520008:1":{"text":"好，前情提要就到这里吧，接下来该开始干活了！","source_cn":"好，前情提要就到这里吧，接下来该开始干活了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86976FDE1FD6B7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1222520008":{"text":"好，前情提要就到这里吧，接下来该开始干活了！","source_cn":"好，前情提要就到这里吧，接下来该开始干活了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86976FDE1FD6B7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222520009:1":{"text":"咱们得一起解决在这四周徘徊的脏东西。之后大家再一起想办法，看能不能让我和奥曼斯精心编织的漂亮梦境恢复原样！","source_cn":"咱们得一起解决在这四周徘徊的脏东西。之后大家再一起想办...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C8C28B6583AF3DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222520010:0"